  (text_box "- U1 (QFN-48) marked \"2184A 533AQ1H\": maker not identified (IP804AR is the\n  closest public 4-port PSE in QFN-48 7x7).\n- Per channel: 0.25 Ohm \"R250\" sense (R8, R12, R13, R14), 33 Ohm \"330\" (R3, R9,\n  R10, R11), SMB TVS \"RGS\" (D1, D3, D5, D7; one more next to C7).\n- The module silk reuses mainboard reference numbers, so its parts are\n  renumbered here (R1xx, D1xx, U101); the \"Silk\" field keeps the silk name.\n- The topology is a guess. How the module gets 48 V and GND is unknown." (at 81.28 129.54 0) (size 119.38 15.24) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 120 120 120 1)) (fill (type color) (color 255 255 225 1)) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid c37d68c1-1670-45fd-ab71-f9914801ebe9))
